OL,3,CNorth Belfast attacks being treated as
OL,4,Cracially motivated hate crimes
OL,6,FTwo incidents of criminal damage at a
OL,7,Fhouse in north Belfast are being
OL,8,Ftreated by police as racially
OL,9,Fmotivated hate crimes.
OL,11,FDetectives are appealing for
OL,12,Finformation about the attacks on the
OL,13,Fproperty in the Forthriver Road area.
OL,15,FA PSNI spokesperson said: "Police
OL,16,Freceived a report shortly before
OL,17,F7:40am on Sunday 16th August that
OL,18,Fgraffiti had been sprayed on a house
OL,19,Fin the area sometime between 10pm on
OL,20,FSaturday 15th August and 7am on Sunday
OL,21,F16th August.
OL,26,@wD@[OU
