OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1787069924
OL,3,CNorth Belfast attacks being treated as
OL,4,Cracially motivated hate crimes
OL,6,F"It was reported that a front door
OL,7,Fwindow pane of the property was
OL,8,Fdamaged during the incident.
OL,10,F"At around 00:45am on Monday 17th
OL,11,FAugust, police received a report that
OL,12,Fa living room window of the property
OL,13,Fwas smashed.
OL,15,F"It was reported that a male wearing a
OL,16,Fblack coloured hooded top and riding a
OL,17,Fblack bicycle left the scene following
OL,18,Fthe incident.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/4
