CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1787069924
OL,3,CNorth Belfast attacks being treated as
OL,4,Cracially motivated hate crimes
OL,6,F"Enquiries are continuing and at this
OL,7,Fstage, both incidents are being
OL,8,Ftreated as racially motivated hate
OL,9,Fcrimes."
OL,11,FPolice have appealed for information
OL,12,Fabout the incidents.
OL,14,FLocal DUP MLA Brian Kingston said:
OL,15,F"This is an appalling incident.
OL,16,FGraffiti like this and attacks on
OL,17,Fproperty are not wanted in Glencairn.
OL,18,FThis has caused outrage locally and
OL,19,Fdoes not represent the people of this
OL,20,Fcommunity.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@HO]wD@AOU
