OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1787069924
OL,3,CNorth Belfast attacks being treated as
OL,4,Cracially motivated hate crimes
OL,6,F"I am told that this family has lived
OL,7,Fin Glencairn for several years.
OL,8,FWhoever carried out this attack is not
OL,9,Facting in the interest of the good
OL,10,Fpeople of Glencairn.
OL,12,F"I would urge anyone who can assist
OL,13,Fthe police to ascertain those
OL,14,Fresponsible to pass on any information
OL,15,Fthey have."
